                <pb facs="0830" n="696" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg696"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 780.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rives to Mr. Phelan.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-02-01"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 1,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In regard to the cases at Halifax, reported Monday by you, has any thing further
                    been decided? Telegraph answer.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rives.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
